 firm is (and I am) in breach of 1.4 of the code of conduct. This applies not only to correspondence to the Defendant firms, but also to clients and any external parties.




This requires immediate attention, especially in respect of my position.&nbsp;




SL have asked for a response by 4pm. Without wanting to force the hands of the board, I must be insistent that the below (or clarification of that nature) is sent before that deadline to clarify the position:




&quot;Pogust Goodhead are considering your application and will respond in due course.&nbsp;




